{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### SWIFT Networking\n\nUser-journey health for SWIFT-attached management cluster networking: secondary NIC assignment (router pod startup) and the Konnectivity tunnel/data path.\n\n**Sections:**\n- **Router / NIC Assignment** \u2014 router pod startup latency (p99) and pending-IP-programming count, per management cluster datasource. Use the `datasource` selector to pick a single management cluster or `All` to compare fleet-wide/regionally.\n- **CNS DaemonSet** \u2014 azure-cns DaemonSet availability, per management cluster.\n- **Konnectivity Tunnel** \u2014 stream error rate and dial failure rate, indicating tunnel/data-path health distinct from NIC assignment.\n\n**Datasources:**\n- Router latency and Konnectivity panels use the **HCP AMW** (`Managed_Prometheus_hcps-*`) \u2014 see `arohcp_swift_networking_slo_recording_rules` / `arohcp_swift_konnectivity_recording_rules` in `observability/alerts/swift-networking-recordingRule-KSM.yaml`.\n- CNS panels use the **services AMW** (`Managed_Prometheus_services-*`) \u2014 CNS is a fleet/node-scoped DaemonSet in `kube-system`, not per-HCP. See `arohcp_swift_cns_latency_recording_rules` / `arohcp_swift_cns_availability_recording_rules` in `observability/recording-rules/swift-networking-cns-recordingRule.yaml`.\n\n**Usage:** referenced from the SWIFT TSG (`swift-tsg.md`) Step 1 blast-radius triage \u2014 select `All` on each datasource variable to check whether an issue is isolated to one management cluster/region or fleet-wide.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "title": "Dashboard Info",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Router / NIC Assignment",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_hcp}"
      },
      "description": "p99 duration router pods have been stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending. No series = healthy (no router pods stuck).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_hcp}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "router:startup_latency:p99",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Router Startup Latency p99 (by HCP namespace)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_hcp}"
      },
      "description": "Count of HCP namespaces with any router pod stuck > 300s (SLO threshold). Compare across the datasource selector to spot single-HCP vs fleet-wide vs regional patterns.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_hcp}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(router:startup_latency:p99 > 300) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "HCPs affected",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HCPs With Router Pods Stuck > 300s",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
      },
      "description": "cx_pending_programming_ips_v2 sustained non-zero indicates CNS is failing to program secondary IPs. Sourced from the services AMW (fleet/node-scoped, not per-HCP). One series per CNS pod (1:1 with management cluster worker nodes) - identify by pod name, not summed, to support blast-radius triage (single node vs. cluster-wide).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "cx_pending_programming_ips_v2",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Pending IP Programming",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "id": 12,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "NIC Capacity",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
      },
      "description": "Management cluster worker nodes reporting zero SWIFT NIC capacity. No series = healthy. Any results = mgmt-agent not reporting NIC capacity on that node.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "kube_node_status_capacity{resource=\"aro_openshift_io_swift_nic\"} == 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Management Cluster Worker Nodes With Zero SWIFT NIC Capacity",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
      },
      "description": "Divergence between reported NIC capacity and allocatable. Non-zero = mgmt-agent under-reporting vs. what the node can hold; also compare against the VMSS SKU's max secondary NIC count in Azure - if the VMSS is at its NIC ceiling, no mgmt-agent fix will help.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "id": 14,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "kube_node_status_capacity{resource=\"aro_openshift_io_swift_nic\"} - on(node) kube_node_status_allocatable{resource=\"aro_openshift_io_swift_nic\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "SWIFT NIC Capacity vs. Allocatable Divergence",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "id": 6,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "CNS DaemonSet",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
      },
      "description": "Ratio of ready to desired azure-cns DaemonSet pods. SLO: >= 99.9% over 28 days. A drop indicates node-level or cluster-wide CNS unavailability.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.9
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.999
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "cns:daemonset_availability:ratio",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Availability",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "CNS DaemonSet Availability",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
      },
      "description": "p99 latency of CNS secondary IP assignment. SLO: <= 10s p99 over 28 days.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_svc}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "cns:ip_assignment_latency:p99",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "CNS IP Assignment Latency p99",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      },
      "id": 9,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Konnectivity Tunnel",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_hcp}"
      },
      "description": "Konnectivity server-side stream error rate. Elevated errors with router pods otherwise Running indicate a tunnel/data-path issue, not NIC assignment.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_hcp}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "konnectivity:stream_error_rate:5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Konnectivity Stream Error Rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_hcp}"
      },
      "description": "Konnectivity dial failure rate (failures / (failures + successful dials)). Elevated dial failures with router pods otherwise Running indicate a tunnel/data-path issue, not NIC assignment.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 38
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_hcp}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "konnectivity:dial_failure_rate:5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Konnectivity Dial Failure Rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "HCP Datasource",
        "name": "datasource_hcp",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "^Managed_Prometheus_hcps-.*$",
        "type": "datasource"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Services Datasource",
        "name": "datasource_svc",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "^Managed_Prometheus_services-.*$",
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "utc",
  "title": "SWIFT Networking",
  "uid": "swift-networking",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
